id: pm-review-review-carry-forward
title: Carry review attention across unaffected artifact revisions
description: Compare explicitly reviewed artifact and criterion digests across revisions while keeping retained attention separate from exact-artifact approval.
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T05:49:03.857Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-25T06:18:11.536Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Unrelated artifact edits preserve only unaffected obligations; Touched evidence invalidates its judgments; Retained attention never becomes fresh exact-artifact approval; Typed SDK and agent-sized CLI with actionable refusals work without git; Seeded state and replay properties and every read interleaving are verified on a plain tracker; Read-only public tracker measurements and npm plus Bun CI release gates are recorded
parent: pm-review-epic
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T05:49:32.753Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against the pinned CLI SDK and fleet pm-review, pm-evidence and pm-context sources. Coverage records whole-contract criterion attention; lineage joins equivalent observations; core supplies verified historical item reads and complete native fields; pm-evidence owns citation/version resolution. None computes obligation scope across artifact revisions. Design: read-only explicit review scope receipts captured from verified SDK history; compare per-criterion selected native fields and complete evidence digests against current SDK state, report unchanged/stale/never-reviewed/removed obligations, always leave exact-artifact approval unverified. No new import/export/sync mutations, leases, outboxes or idempotency keys. Exercise receipt JSON replay plus all touched native fields and relationships through real SDK readback. Published CLI is now 2026.10.25; retain the existing 2026.10.20 pin as instructed."
  "2026-10-25T06:02:57.472Z",codex-agent,"Implemented read-only captureReviewScope/carryForwardReview and review scope/review carry-forward. Uses core verified historical get and typed history_target_out_of_range version facts; no native tracker serialization, SDK mocks, writer state, imports or idempotency keys. Successor evidence revisions invalidate even restored bytes/timestamps. Functional and every-read-boundary tests currently pass. Public origin/main snapshot: 54 items, 733 history versions, 23 artifacts and JSON/CRLF receipt replays, 21 unchanged obligations, 2 stale, 93 never reviewed, 31 no-criterion/history refusals, 114 source files byte-identical, largest report 1209 bytes, zero exact-artifact approvals."
  "2026-10-25T06:04:44.731Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: changed only carryForwardReview to invalidate every reviewed obligation whenever the whole artifact changed, removing scope retention. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"unrelated edits\" test/scope.test.ts failed 1/1: unrelated priority edit incorrectly produced unchanged=0/stale=2 instead of unchanged=2/stale=0. Restored the function immediately. Out-of-scope SDK importer replay defect is recorded in pm-review-sdk-import-history-gap; new feature refuses unavailable/corrupt history without repair."
  "2026-10-25T06:09:50.986Z",codex-agent,"Overlap detail: pm-context evidence-packing.ts packs complete explicit criterion groups to a byte budget and reports lost coverage; it does not compare artifact revisions. pm-evidence owns external selector/citation drift. Carry-forward consumes exact native SDK values and explicitly versioned evidence, so it does not duplicate either feature. Public validation refusals were exactly 31 criterion_unknown items (no AC1 at version 1), with no history failures. Packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance passed 1/1. Targeted scope modules measured 100/100/100/100 without threshold changes."
  "2026-10-25T06:12:56.324Z",codex-agent,"Seeded model passed: seed 1371598885, 500 random sequences, 2988 operations, 1988 comparisons, 75 native SDK fields. Old receipt JSON/CRLF replays preserved SDK-read native items, relationship graphs and immutable history. Functional/interleaving tests passed 6/6; expanded comparison covers 15 boundaries for each artifact and evidence (30 cases), capture 5 boundaries. Targeted scope coverage remains 100/100/100/100. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, zero-duplication and docstring gates passed. Full npm and Bun release evidence will come from CI; results and exact run link will be added to the PR. Local strict health reports only an ignored installed pm-github host-version cache skew (20 versus 24), with storage, integrity and history checks healthy; fresh CI will verify the tracked project."
  "2026-10-25T06:18:10.264Z",codex-agent,"Strengthened the seeded reference model before final CI: declared obligations now come independently from the input selection, not the generated receipt. Assert exact preservation of every selected field, criterion, evidence identity/version and judgment in the exported receipt. Half the description/body mutation sequences now include whitespace/CRLF-only edits, evaluated against native SDK readback. This closes a potential blind spot where a dropped selector could otherwise be copied into the reference model. Final CI will rerun all 500 sequences at the new head."
